# ===========================================
# BINANCE AUTOTRADING CONFIGURATION
# ===========================================
# IMPORTANT: Get these from https://www.binance.com/en/account/api-management
# Steps:
# 1. Log in to Binance and go to API Management 
# 2. Create new API Key with name like "Plan Before Trade Bot" 
# 3. Enable these permissions:
#    - Enable Reading (default)
#    - Enable Spot & Margin Trading
# 4. Set IP Whitelist to your server IP (or leave empty for testing)
# 5. Confirm via email
# 6. Copy the API Key and Secret Key below
#
